<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <template id="report_water_document">
        <t t-call="tlip_base.tlip_layout">
            <t t-set="doc" t-value="doc.with_context(lang=doc.partner_id.lang)" />
            <t t-set="data" t-value="doc._generate_report_payment_request()" />
            <div class="page" style="font-family:Times New Roman">
                <div class="row" style="padding-top:20px">
                    <div class="col-3"></div>
                    <div class="col-6" style="text-align:center">
                        <h3>
                            <b>YÊU CẦU THANH TOÁN</b>
                        </h3>
                        <h3>
                            <b>REQUEST FOR PAYMENT</b>
                        </h3>
                        <p>Số/ <span style="font-style: italic">Ref :</span><t
                                t-esc="data['request_payment_number']" /></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-3"></div>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0">Ngày/<i>Date:</i> <span t-esc="data['date']" /></p>
                <p>Kính gửi/ <span style="font-style: italic"></span>Dear,</p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0">Khách hàng: <span t-esc="data['partner_name_vn']" /></p>
                <p>Customer: <span t-esc="data['partner_name_en']" /></p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0">Địa chỉ: <span t-esc="data['partner_address_vn']" /></p>
                <p>Address: <span t-esc="data['partner_address_en']" /></p>
                <p>Mã số thuế/ <span style="font-style: italic"></span>Tax code: <span
                        t-esc="data['vat']" /></p>
                <div class="row mb-1">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <p>Mã khách hàng/ <i>Tenant code: </i><span t-esc="data['partner_code']" /></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <p>Mã điểm đo/ <i>Measuring point code: </i><span
                                t-esc="data['metering_point']" /></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p>Loại hình doanh nghiệp/ <span style="font-style: italic"></span>Business Entity
                    Type: <t t-esc="data['business_type']" /></p>
                <p class="mb-0 mt-2">Căn cứ vào Điều <span t-esc="data['contract_payment_article']" />
                    của Hợp đồng số <span t-esc="data['contract_number']" /> ký ngày <span
                        t-esc="data['contract_signing_date']" /> và các Phụ lục Hợp đồng. Chúng tôi
                    đề nghị Quý công ty thanh toán cho chúng tôi khoản tiền như sau:</p>
                <p class="mb-4" style="font-style: italic">In accordance with the Article .<span
                        t-esc="data['contract_payment_article']" /> of Agreement No. <span
                        t-esc="data['contract_number']" /> signed on <span
                        t-esc="data['contract_signing_date']" />, and Supplement Agreement. We would
                    like you to make the payment for the fee to us as follows:</p>
                <p style="font-weight: bold; font-size:15pt; margin-bottom: 0">I. Nội dung thanh toán/ <i>Content of
                    payment</i></p>
                <div class="row">
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 0"><strong>Kỳ/ <i>Period</i></strong>: Từ/ <span
                            style="font-style: italic">from</span> <span
                            t-esc="data['utitlity_period_from']" /> Đến/<span
                            style="font-style: italic">To</span> <span
                            t-esc="data['utitlity_period_to']" /></p>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-9"></div>
                    <div class="col-3">
                        <p>Đơn vị tiền tệ/ <i>Currency Unit</i>: <span t-esc="data['currency']" /></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
                    <thead style="display: table-row-group">
                        <tr style="vertical-align: middle;">
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">
                                STT <br /><i>No</i><br />(1)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">Hàng
                                hóa và dịch vụ <br /><i>Goods &amp; Service</i><br />(2)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">Chỉ
                                số cũ <br /><i>Last index</i><br />(3)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">Chỉ
                                số mới <br /><i>New index</i><br />(4)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">
                                ĐVT <br /><i>Unit</i><br />(5)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">Số
                                lượng <br /><i>Quantity</i><br />(6=(4-3)*5)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">Đơn
                                giá <br /><i>Price</i><br />(7)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">Thành
                                tiền <br /><i>Amount</i><br />(8=6x7)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">Thuế
                                suất <br /><i>Tax rate</i><br />(9)</th>
                            <th
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; background-color: #f2f2f2;text-align: center;">Thuế
                                GTGT <br /><i>VAT amount</i><br />(10=8x9)</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="sale_tbody">
                        <t t-foreach="data['invoice_lines']" t-as="invoice_line">
                            <tr style="vertical-align: middle;">
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: center;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['index']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;white-space:pre-line; word-wrap:break-word;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <p t-esc="invoice_line['name']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['last_value']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['new_value']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['uom']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['utility_quantity']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['price_unit']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['subtotal']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['tax_rate']" />
                                </td>
                                <td
                                    style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;vertical-align: middle;">
                                    <span t-esc="invoice_line['tax_amount']" />
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </t>
                        <tr>
                            <td
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: center;"
                                colspan="5">
                                <strong>Tổng cộng/<i>Total :</i></strong>
                            </td>
                            <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;" />
                            <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;" />
                            <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;">
                                <span t-esc="data['amount_untaxed']" />
                            </td>
                            <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;" />
                            <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px;text-align: right;">
                                <span t-esc="data['amount_tax']" />
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid white"
                                colspan="3">
                                <strong>Cộng tiền hàng/ <i>Sub-total:</i></strong>
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="2"
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: right; border: 1px solid white">
                                <span t-esc="data['amount_untaxed']" />
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="4"
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid white" />
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid white"
                                colspan="3">
                                <strong>Tổng tiền thuế/ <i>Total VAT amount:</i></strong>
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="2"
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: right; border: 1px solid white">
                                <span t-esc="data['amount_tax']" />
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="4"
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid white" />
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid white"
                                colspan="3">
                                <strong>Tổng tiền phải trả/ <i>Total payable:</i></strong>
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="2"
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; text-align: right; border: 1px solid white">
                                <span t-esc="data['amount_total']" />
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="4"
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid white" />
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="9"
                                style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid white">
                                (Bằng chữ: <span style="white-space:pre" t-esc="data['amount_in_words_vn']"/>&#9;chẵn) <br />
                                (<i>In words: <span t-esc="data['amount_in_words_en']" />)</i>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <div class="row mt-2 mb-2">
                    <div class="col-4">
                        <p style="font-weight: bold;font-size:15pt">II. Hạn thanh toán / <i>Due
                                date:</i></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-4">
                        <span t-esc="data['due_date']" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p style="font-weight: bold;font-size:15pt">III. Thông tin tài khoản / <i>Bank
                    account:</i></p>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 0">Vui lòng chuyển số tiền phải trả vào tài khoản ngân hàng của chúng
                    tôi theo thông tin sau: </p>
                <p style="font-style:italic">Please remit the payable amount to our bank account as
                    belows: </p>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-3"> Tên tài khoản/ <span style="font-style:italic">Account Name</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-4">
                        <span t-field="doc.company_id.name"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <t t-if="data['company_bank_accounts']">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-3"> Số tài khoản/ <span style="font-style:italic">Account
                            Number</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-9" style="padding-left:10px">
                            <span>
                                <b>
                                    <t t-esc="data['company_bank_accounts'][0]" />
                                </b>
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <t t-if="len(data['company_bank_accounts']) &gt; 1">
                        <t t-foreach="data['company_bank_accounts'][1:]" t-as="company_bank_account">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-3"> Hoặc/ <span style="font-style:italic">Or</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-9" style="padding-left:10px">
                                    <span>
                                        <b>
                                            <t t-esc="company_bank_account" />
                                        </b>
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </t>
                    </t>
                </t>

                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-3"> Lưu ý/ <span style="font-style:italic">Note</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-9" style="padding-left:10px">
                        <b>Phí của ngân hàng sẽ được trả bởi khách hàng/ <span
                                style="font-style:italic">Bank's charge shall be borne by you.</span></b>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <br />

                <div class="mb-2">
                    <b>Nếu có vấn đề gì thắc mắc, vui lòng liên hệ với chúng tôi vào bất kỳ thời
                        gian nào.</b>
                    <br />
                    <span style="font-style:italic">
                        <b>If you have any queries on this matter, please feel free to contact us at
                            any time.</b>
                    </span>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-bottom: 50px;"> Xin chân thành cảm ơn / <i>Faithfully</i> yours, </div>

                <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-left: 40px"> ĐẠI DIỆN CÔNG TY <br />
                    <i>(ON
                    BEHALF OF COMPANY)</i>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top: 70px; margin-left: 40px;">{{USER-SIGNATURE}}</div>
                <div class="oe_structure" />
            </div>
        </t>
    </template>

    <template id="report_water_raw">
        <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="doc">
                <t t-call="tlip_account.report_water_document"
                    t-lang="doc.partner_id.lang" />
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>

    <template id="report_water">
        <t t-call="tlip_account.report_water_raw" />
    </template>

</odoo>
